    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "22115e956aac72c6",
      "translationZh": "微调与拒绝机制消除",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "10977cc23f96b2f1",
      "translationZh": "推理服务器支持与配置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b3efddf83cc4113c",
      "translationZh": "使用体验、基准测试与模型对比",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "291d39005acec686",
      "translationZh": "我们会尽量清理今后围绕此次发布出现的重复帖子，并引导大家到这里讨论。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "03fbe706c151c09d",
      "translationZh": "GLM-5.3-Flash 是 GLM-5 系列中首个原生多模态模型，也是 glm5_next 架构的首个开放权重版本。Z.ai 的宣传主张是：以十分之一的价格超越 GLM-5.2，同时在编程和智能体基准测试上接近 Claude Opus 4.8。它引入了：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "47f0ce01867af87f",
      "translationZh": "混合稀疏注意力 + 线性注意力：45 层按重复块排列，每个块先是 3x KDA 线性注意力，接着是 1x DeepSeek 风格的稀疏注意力（34 个线性注意力层 / 11 个稀疏注意力层）。稀疏层使用 lightning 索引器（32 个头，dim 128），top-k 预算为 2048 个词元，大幅降低长上下文服务成本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bfd4324c082dd91a",
      "translationZh": "流形约束超连接（mHC）：加宽残差流，并在层间采用受流形约束的混合，以进一步提高规模扩展效率。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c31ff772e3d9cfdd",
      "translationZh": "原生多模态：采用一个 24 层的 ViT（448px、图像块大小为 14、2x2 空间合并），并使用时序分块，因此图像和视频 token 都包含在词表中。在一个包含 30T token 的多模态语料库上训练。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0f6a4f9b03c16648",
      "translationZh": "权重中随附 MTP 头：包含 1 个 next-N 预测层；官方 vLLM 配置方案使用该预测头，并设置 5 个推测 token。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0564e64732b55502",
      "translationZh": "FP8 优先：主仓库采用 FP8（e4m3，动态激活缩放）。另有一个独立的官方 BF16 仓库。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5f9dbd2705f3f8ec",
      "translationZh": "类型：带视觉编码器的因果语言模型（ Glm5NextForConditionalGeneration ）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "95878182f65f6b94",
      "translationZh": "训练阶段：预训练（30T 多模态 token）与后训练",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3beb4b3a632e801a",
      "translationZh": "参数数量：320B，其中激活参数为 18B",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6c5d97241b365bac",
      "translationZh": "层数：45（前 3 层为稠密 MLP，其余 42 层为 MoE）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7eb3e609a35de598",
      "translationZh": "隐藏层布局：11 x (3 x (KDA 线性注意力 -> MoE) -> 1 x (稀疏注意力 -> MoE))，再加上末尾的 1 个线性层",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cff5b3a21b905297",
      "translationZh": "KDA 线性注意力（34 层）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "754b21034e8c89e6",
      "translationZh": "稀疏注意力（11 层，DeepSeek 风格）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c5b8a3f214b5e444",
      "translationZh": "注意力头数量：64",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6fe83c6ef4d52d02",
      "translationZh": "QK / V 头维度：256 / 256",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6d16402e9913de81",
      "translationZh": "索引器：32 个头，头维度 128",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7f53cd2dca6856af",
      "translationZh": "专家数量：288 个路由专家 + 1 个共享专家",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
